OL,3,ATrump says men arrested over RAF
OL,4,AFairford incident had been 'under view
OL,5,Afor a long time'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn image geolocated by BBC Verify
OL,8,Fappears to show the detained men close
OL,9,Fto the RAF base
OL,11,FGloucestershire Police say the force
OL,12,Freceived a call at about 00:45 BST on
OL,13,FSunday morning relating to "three
OL,14,Fsuspicious vehicles" travelling towards
OL,15,Fthe RAF base
OL,17,FAt a news conference, Gloucestershire
OL,18,Fpolice's Assistant Chief Constable
OL,19,FRichard Ocone says "work to establish
OL,20,Fthe full nature of the incident is
OL,21,Fongoing", as 85 homes have been
OL,22,Fevacuated
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
